        "Needu bhaaramu moyu aa Devudu",
        "Neeku mundugaa naduchu ellappudu (2)",
        "Neeloni aa bhayamu – Lokaaniki prathiroopam",
        "Sthiramaina nee vishwaasam – Devuniki santhosham (2) ||Kanta||"
